WEBVTT - Security and operations: agent skills for TYPO3 (en)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.262
Editors with exactly the rights they need, and
an installation that is hardened and runs the
right jobs.

2
00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:16.409
Security and operations: four skills for TYPO3
v14.

3
00:00:17.709 --> 00:00:27.857
Hardens a v14 installation: trusted hosts, the
Install Tool, two-factor sign-in, CSP and safe
queries.

4
00:00:29.207 --> 00:00:40.557
It fixes the classic findings the TYPO3 way:
user input concatenated into SQL becomes a
QueryBuilder query with bound values.

5
00:00:41.957 --> 00:00:48.761
Builds and audits editor groups, page and
language rights, MFA and login branding.

6
00:00:50.111 --> 00:00:55.662
The lab fails: three groups, no leaves, 56
findings.

7
00:00:56.762 --> 00:01:03.227
Plans and checks the Scheduler tasks an
installation needs, with groups and safe
intervals.

8
00:01:04.577 --> 00:01:13.419
It finds jobs that are missing, late or
ungrouped, and repairs task rows left without a
type after a v14 update.

9
00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:20.370
Scores a deployable project with Docker or
Compose against a gold standard.

10
00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:28.237
It is the project counterpart to
typo3-conformance, which checks single
extensions.

11
00:01:29.837 --> 00:01:33.899
Open source. Clone the skills, and help us
improve them.
